  // --- X: after Bird mode's finale you're home: plain old Twitter. Winning once (TWITTER_KEY, kept in
  // localStorage) gives you two worlds, each a page load (X picks its theme as it loads: see the top):
  // - the bird world (THEME_KEY 'bird', where the win leaves you): X in light mode with the bird logo. The
